{title: My soul says yes}
{x_theme: praise, blood, salvation, testimony}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/My soul says yes.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
My soul says yes to the Lord,
My soul says yes to the Lord
For He’s a great King, He’s doing great things
My soul says yes, yes, yes to the Lord

{comment: Verse 1}
He brought me out of darkness
Into His marvelous light
He set my soul on straight street
Gave me the strength to fight

{comment: Verse 2}
I’ve been tempted, I’ve been tried
I am a conqueror through the blood of Jesus Christ
He’s a great King, He’s doing great things
My soul says yes, yes, yes to the Lord

{comment: Verse 3}
I’ve got a new song the angels cannot sing
Glory hallelujah, I have been redeemed
He’s a great King, He’s doing great things
My soul says yes, yes, yes to the Lord
